{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meta/hermes/compare/static_h...cb8a9a3fa39f9165f6db93dcee871cfa625a9753","html_url":"https://github.com/meta/hermes/compare/static_h...cb8a9a3fa39f9165f6db93dcee871cfa625a9753","permalink_url":"https://github.com/meta/hermes/compare/meta:d864d3f...meta:cb8a9a3","diff_url":"https://github.com/meta/hermes/compare/static_h...cb8a9a3fa39f9165f6db93dcee871cfa625a9753.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/meta/hermes/compare/static_h...cb8a9a3fa39f9165f6db93dcee871cfa625a9753.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"d864d3f09d10e8aebe429715eeed5a4d7edf114d","node_id":"C_kwDOCTDsq9oAKGQ4NjRkM2YwOWQxMGU4YWViZTQyOTcxNWVlZWQ1YTRkN2VkZjExNGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Gang Zhao","email":"zhaogang@meta.com","date":"2026-11-21T18:15:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"meta-codesync[bot]","email":"215208954+meta-codesync[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-21T18:15:16Z"},"message":"Skip SamplingProfilerTest.MigrationBeforePreviousThreadExitPreservesOwnership under TSan\n\nSummary:\nThis test, added in D120841250, deadlocks in `fbcode//mode/dev-tsan` and hits the 10-minute timeout in `HermesUnitTests` and `HermesUnitTests_JSIUnstable`. It passes in dev and opt.\n\nTSan defers an asynchronous signal until the target thread passes through a TSan interceptor, and libstdc++'s `std::future::wait()` blocks in a raw futex syscall that TSan does not intercept. While the main thread waits on `registeredFuture` and still owns `rt`, the timer thread sends it SIGPROF and waits for the handler while holding `profilerLock_`. The worker blocks on `profilerLock_` in `setRuntimeThread()` before it can fulfil the future, so no thread makes progress. Without TSan the kernel runs the handler during the futex wait.\n\nSkip the test under TSan, with a comment explaining why.\n\n___\n\nlanded-with-radar-review\n\nDifferential Revision: D133750377\n\nfbshipit-source-id: 610d9c02b2834021ef46012205b187692ac0dc90","tree":{"sha":"6e6afbc412ed4eb2aef7435ec1da8cecc0bec7c2","url":"h